msgid ""
"This board-specific one-shot script should contain any system-level "
"configuration required for running ardupilot. Adjust as needed, and place in"
" /etc/systemd/system/ardupilot-sysconfig.service ."
msgstr ""
"此飞控板专属的一次性脚本应包含运行 ArduPilot 所需的所有系统级配置。按需调整后放置于 "
"/etc/systemd/system/ardupilot-sysconfig.service。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-init-scripts.rst:59
#: 0537e71913bb401f94ad22515d2a975c
msgid ""
"This build-type specific script contains the startup options. Adjust as "
"needed(and per-build), and place in /etc/systemd/system/arduplane.service"
msgstr ""
"此构建类型专属脚本包含启动选项。按需（并按构建类型）调整后放置于 /etc/systemd/system/arduplane.service"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-init-scripts.rst:101
#: 87d3489363c9420ca37cd615d48077d7
msgid ""
"To start, ``sudo systemctl start arduplane``. To check on it, ``sudo "
"systemctl status arduplane``. To restart, ``sudo systemctl restart "
"arduplane``. To stop, ``sudo systemctl stop arduplane``. To enable service "
"startup at boot, ``sudo systemctl enable arduplane`` Note that only one "
"build must be running at a time."
msgstr ""
"启动：``sudo systemctl start arduplane``。查看状态：``sudo systemctl status "
"arduplane``。重启：``sudo systemctl restart arduplane``。停止：``sudo systemctl stop"
" arduplane``。启用开机自启：``sudo systemctl enable arduplane``。注意同一时间只能运行一个构建。"
